    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Santa needs every present out before Christmas. Each day has a WISH LIST of toys.\n\n1. Clock in at the green CLOCK IN button to start the day's shift.\n2. Broken toys arrive on the delivery table. Salvage good parts at the SALVAGE bench,\n    scrub dirty toys in the tub, and fit parts at the ASSEMBLY bench.\n3. Ship finished toys at the SHIPPING chute. Each must match a wish exactly.\n4. Watch for faulty parts: rusty keys, leaking batteries, wobbly wheels, loose eyes.\n5. Fill every wish before time runs out, or meet the trapdoor.\n\nWASD move  \xB7  Mouse look  \xB7  Shift sprint  \xB7  Space hop\nE / Click interact  \xB7  Q drop  \xB7  Esc pause"
